%% Máquina de estados del grafo LangGraph (OdontokingAgent)
%% Render: VSCode (Markdown Preview Mermaid Support) o https://mermaid.live
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> chat: entry_point
    chat --> tool_call: AIMessage con tool_calls
    chat --> [*]: respuesta final (END)
    tool_call --> chat: ToolMessages (retry_policy=3)

    note right of chat
        Carga system prompt (odontoking.md)
        + contexto paciente + fecha Bolivia.
        Llama OpenAI directamente
        (NO usa llm_service: sin fallback)
    end note

    note right of tool_call
        Ejecuta tools en paralelo (gather).
        10 tools: services, doctors, slots,
        horarios, disponibilidad, insurance,
        update_crm, get_citas, transcript...
    end note

    state "GraphRecursionError" as ERR
    chat --> ERR: recursion_limit=50
    ERR --> [*]: ⚠ clear_history (borra checkpoint)
